{"seq":7,"slug":"immunology-fundamentals","title":"免疫学基础","stage":"DONE","category":"health-medicine","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/immunology-fundamentals","rating":{"composite":3.67,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":3.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 免疫学基础\n\n人体每天都在与无数微生物打交道，绝大多数时候我们毫无察觉——这背后是一套极其精巧的防御系统在默默运转。免疫学就是研究这套系统的学科：它如何分辨「自己」与「非己」，如何在几分钟内启动初步防御，又如何在几天内调动出针对特定病原的精确打击，并把这次经历记住一辈子。这个 hub 不追求面面俱到的教科书式罗列，而是顺着一条清晰的递进脉络，把免疫学最核心的逻辑讲透。\n\n整个 hub 由四章构成，层层递进，构成一条从「认识系统」到「应用于健康」的完整路径。\n\n第一章「免疫系统概览」搭建总体框架：先天免疫是数小时内启动的古老防线，适应性免疫是能定制、有记忆的高级防御，二者分工互补；这一章还交代了免疫细胞从何而来、在哪些器官受训与作战。它是理解后面一切的地图。\n\n第二章「分子识别机制」深入到分子层面，回答一个根本问题：免疫系统到底「怎么认出」病原？答案是三类识别装置——抗体、MHC 分子、淋巴细胞受体。这一章讲清抗体的结构与功能、MHC 如何把细胞内部状态「展示」给 T 细胞、以及 V(D)J 重组如何制造出近乎无限的受体多样性。它是整个 hub 的机制核心。\n\n第三章「免疫应答过程」把静态的分子动起来，讲述一次完整应答的时间轴：炎症与补体作为先天免疫的执行层率先动手，体液免疫在生发中心优化抗体，细胞免疫派出杀伤性 T 细胞清除内鬼，最后所有应答沉淀为可终生调用的免疫记忆。它把前两章的「零件」组装成「运转的机器」。\n\n第四章「免疫与健康疾病」是落地与应用：免疫记忆如何被疫苗调用以预防疾病、免疫失控如何导致过敏与自身免疫、以及如何把基础免疫学转化为抗癌的武器。这一章大量引用 2026 年的真实进展——个性化 mRNA 癌症疫苗、CAR-T 跨界治疗狼疮、检查点抑制剂——展示基础研究如何兑现为临床突破。\n\n四章之间不是孤立的：分子识别为应答提供工具，应答机制为疾病与治疗提供解释，而疾病章节又不断回指前面的基础概念。建议按顺序阅读，但每篇都通过交叉链接与其他篇相连，可随时跳转追溯一个概念的来龙去脉。读完整个 hub，你将拥有一张能把任何免疫学新闻、任何疫苗或免疫疗法都「安放进去」的认知框架。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"overview","title":"免疫系统概览","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/immunology-fundamentals/overview","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"innate-immunity","title":"先天免疫","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/immunology-fundamentals/overview/innate-immunity"},{"seq":2,"slug":"adaptive-immunity","title":"适应性免疫","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/immunology-fundamentals/overview/adaptive-immunity"},{"seq":3,"slug":"organs-cells","title":"免疫器官与细胞","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/immunology-fundamentals/overview/organs-cells"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"molecular-recognition","title":"分子识别机制","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/immunology-fundamentals/molecular-recognition","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"antibody-structure","title":"抗体结构与功能","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/immunology-fundamentals/molecular-recognition/antibody-structure"},{"seq":2,"slug":"mhc-antigen-presentation","title":"MHC 与抗原呈递","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/immunology-fundamentals/molecular-recognition/mhc-antigen-presentation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"lymphocyte-receptors","title":"T 与 B 细胞受体","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/immunology-fundamentals/molecular-recognition/lymphocyte-receptors"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"immune-response","title":"免疫应答过程","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/immunology-fundamentals/immune-response","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"inflammation-complement","title":"炎症与补体","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/immunology-fundamentals/immune-response/inflammation-complement"},{"seq":2,"slug":"humoral-response","title":"体液免疫应答","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/immunology-fundamentals/immune-response/humoral-response"},{"seq":3,"slug":"cellular-memory","title":"细胞免疫与免疫记忆","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/immunology-fundamentals/immune-response/cellular-memory"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"health-disease","title":"免疫与健康疾病","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/immunology-fundamentals/health-disease","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"vaccine-principles","title":"疫苗原理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/immunology-fundamentals/health-disease/vaccine-principles"},{"seq":2,"slug":"allergy-autoimmunity","title":"过敏与自身免疫","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/immunology-fundamentals/health-disease/allergy-autoimmunity"},{"seq":3,"slug":"tumor-immunotherapy","title":"肿瘤免疫与免疫疗法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/immunology-fundamentals/health-disease/tumor-immunotherapy"}]}]}